@startuml service-agentic-realization-boundary
title Service vs Agentic Service Realization Boundary
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

class "Service\n<<universal>>" as svc
class "Agentic Service\n<<specialization>>" as asvc

svc <|-- asvc : contextual specialization

note right of svc
  Means through which value
  is made available
  per ADR-ES-002
end note

note right of asvc
  How the service is delivered
  (material agentic behavior)
  per ADR-ES-014 §3
end note

note bottom of asvc
  Agentic behavior qualifies realization
  Does NOT redefine Service
end note
@enduml
